    <item>
      <title>Kubernetes The Hard Way no Slackware 15 – Parte 05</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-05/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 05 Nov 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>eurodrigolira@gmail.com (Rodrigo Lira)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-05/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;images/k8s-slackware.png&#34; &gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;150&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;150&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-05/images/k8s-slackware-150x150.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-05/images/k8s-slackware-150x150.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-05/images/k8s-slackware-150x150.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-05/images/k8s-slackware-150x150.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Salve Salve Pessoal!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Dando continuidade a nossa serie de posts Kubernetes The Hard Way no Slackware 15, neste post vamos ver como gerar os arquivos de configurações para autenticação dos componentes do kubernetes, nós vamos gerar os arquivos para o &lt;strong&gt;controller manager&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;kubelet&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;kube-proxy&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;kube-scheduler&lt;/strong&gt; e para o usuário &lt;strong&gt;admin&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
