      <author>eurodrigolira@gmail.com (Rodrigo Lira)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-04/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-04/images/k8s-slackware.png&#34; &gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;261&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;161&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-04/images/k8s-slackware.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-04/images/k8s-slackware.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-04/images/k8s-slackware.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/kubernetes-the-hard-way-no-slackware-15-parte-04/images/k8s-slackware.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Salve Salve Pessoal!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Dando continuidade a nossa serie de posts &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes The Hard Way no Slackware 15&lt;/strong&gt;, nesse post nos vamos ver como criar toda a infraestrutura PKI, usando as ferramentas &lt;strong&gt;cfssl&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;cfssljson&lt;/strong&gt; para provisionar uma &lt;strong&gt;CA&lt;/strong&gt; e gerar todos os &lt;strong&gt;Certificados TLS&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
